## Technical Requirements

### Database Schema

Migration: `0002_create_mcq_tables.sql`

```sql
-- Multiple-choice question (parent)
CREATE TABLE mcqs (
  mcq_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT (lower(hex(randomblob(16)))),
  name TEXT NOT NULL,
  question TEXT NOT NULL,
  created_by TEXT NOT NULL,
  created_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  updated_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  FOREIGN KEY (created_by) REFERENCES users (user_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
);

CREATE INDEX idx_mcqs_created_by ON mcqs (created_by);
CREATE INDEX idx_mcqs_updated_at ON mcqs (updated_at DESC);

-- Answer choices (child); 2–6 per MCQ enforced in service layer
CREATE TABLE choices (
  choice_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT (lower(hex(randomblob(16)))),
  mcq_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  label TEXT NOT NULL,
  is_correct INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK (is_correct IN (0, 1)),
  sort_order INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  created_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  updated_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  FOREIGN KEY (mcq_id) REFERENCES mcqs (mcq_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
);

CREATE INDEX idx_choices_mcq_id ON choices (mcq_id);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_choices_mcq_sort ON choices (mcq_id, sort_order);

-- User attempts (records answer + result)
CREATE TABLE attempts (
  attempt_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT (lower(hex(randomblob(16)))),
  user_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  mcq_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  choice_id TEXT NOT NULL,
  is_correct INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (is_correct IN (0, 1)),
  attempted_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES users (user_id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  FOREIGN KEY (mcq_id) REFERENCES mcqs (mcq_id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  FOREIGN KEY (choice_id) REFERENCES choices (choice_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
);

CREATE INDEX idx_attempts_user_id ON attempts (user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_attempts_mcq_id ON attempts (mcq_id);
```

**Column mapping (domain → database):**

| Domain field   | DB column     | Notes                                           |
|----------------|---------------|-------------------------------------------------|
| McqId          | `mcq_id`      | TEXT hex string, primary key (`id`)             |
| Name           | `name`        | Short title / label for list table              |
| Question       | `question`    | Full question text shown to the teacher/student |
| CreatedBy      | `created_by`  | FK → `users.user_id`; who created the MCQ       |
| CreatedAt      | `created_at`  | When the MCQ was created                        |
| UpdatedAt      | `updated_at`  | When the MCQ was last modified                  |
| ChoiceId       | `choice_id`   | Primary key for each option                     |
| Label          | `label`       | Choice display text                             |
| IsCorrect      | `is_correct`  | `0` or `1`; exactly one `1` per MCQ (service)   |
| SortOrder      | `sort_order`  | `0`–`5` display order                           |
| AttemptId      | `attempt_id`  | Primary key                                     |
| IsCorrectResult| `is_correct`  | Whether selected choice matched correct answer  |

**D1 setup:**

1. `npx wrangler d1 migrations create quizmaker-db create_mcq_tables`
2. Paste SQL above into generated migration file
3. Apply locally only: `npx wrangler d1 migrations apply quizmaker-db --local`

### API Endpoints

Primary mutations use **Server Actions**. Optional route handlers are listed for read clients.

#### Server Actions (primary)

| Action              | File                                      | Input                                                                 | Success result                         | Errors                                      |
|---------------------|-------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| `createMcq`         | `src/app/(app)/questions/new/actions.ts`  | `{ name, question, choices: [{ label, isCorrect }] }` (2–6 items) | Redirect to `/questions`               | 400 validation; 401 unauthenticated         |
| `updateMcq`         | `src/app/(app)/questions/[mcqId]/edit/actions.ts` | Same shape + `mcqId`                                          | Redirect to `/questions`               | 400 validation; 403 not owner; 404 not found |
| `deleteMcq`         | `src/app/(app)/questions/actions.ts`      | `{ mcqId }`                                                           | Revalidate list; success               | 403 not owner; 404 not found                  |
| `recordAttempt`     | `src/app/(app)/questions/[mcqId]/preview/actions.ts` | `{ mcqId, choiceId }                                    | `{ isCorrect: boolean }`               | 400 invalid choice; 401 unauthenticated       |

#### Route Handlers (secondary / optional)

```
