## Test-Driven Development Approach

This feature follows the same TDD workflow established in the login PRD. Vitest harness already exists (`vitest.config.ts`, `src/test/mock-d1.ts`).

### TDD Workflow (every phase)

```
1. Define test cases in this PRD phase plan
2. Write failing unit tests (RED) — `npm run test` must show failures
3. Implement minimal production code (GREEN)
4. Refactor while keeping tests green
5. Phase exit gate: all phase tests pass + mapped acceptance criteria met
```

### Unit Testing Conventions

- **Colocate tests**: `mcq-service.ts` → `mcq-service.test.ts`
- **Mock at boundaries**: mock D1 in repository tests; mock repositories in service tests; mock services in action tests
- **Fixtures**: add `src/test/fixtures/mcqs.ts` for sample MCQ/choice/attempt rows
- **Never hit real D1** in unit tests
- **Client components only** in UI tests — list table menu, form, preview submit

### Phase Completion Gate

A phase is **COMPLETED** only when:

1. All unit tests listed for that phase pass (`npm run test` — 0 failures)
2. Mapped acceptance criteria are verified
3. Phase status marker in this PRD is updated to `COMPLETED`

### Acceptance Criteria ↔ Test Mapping

| Acceptance criterion | Primary test file(s) |
|----------------------|----------------------|
| List page shows MCQs in table | `questions-table.test.tsx`, `mcq-service.test.ts` |
| Create MCQ with 2–6 choices | `mcq-service.test.ts`, `new/actions.test.ts`, `mcq-form.test.tsx` |
| Default 2 choices on create form | `mcq-form.test.tsx` |
| Exactly one correct choice enforced | `mcq.test.ts`, `mcq-service.test.ts` |
| Edit updates MCQ and replaces choices | `mcq-service.test.ts`, `edit/actions.test.ts` |
| Non-owner cannot update/delete | `mcq-service.test.ts`, `*/actions.test.ts` |
| Delete removes MCQ, choices, attempts | `mcq-repository.test.ts`, `mcq-service.test.ts` |
| Preview records attempt with result | `mcq-service.test.ts`, `preview/actions.test.ts` |
| Save/Cancel on form | `mcq-form.test.tsx` |
| Row menu Edit / Preview / Delete | `questions-table.test.tsx` |
| Zod validation before service | `mcq.test.ts`, `*/actions.test.ts` |
| Layered architecture — no layer skipping | Controller tests mock services only |

