## Troubleshooting Guide

### Migration fails: foreign key to users

**Problem**: `mcqs` migration fails on fresh DB without users migration
**Cause**: `0001_create_users_and_sessions.sql` not applied
**Solution**: Apply migrations in order locally: `npx wrangler d1 migrations apply quizmaker-db --local`

### Dropdown menu not installed

**Problem**: `Cannot find module '@/components/ui/dropdown-menu'`
**Cause**: Shadcn component not added
**Solution**: `npx shadcn@latest add dropdown-menu textarea alert-dialog`

### Choice count validation mismatch

**Problem**: Form submits 1 or 7 choices
**Cause**: Client allows invalid state
**Solution**: Disable add/remove at bounds in `mcq-form.tsx`; Zod enforces server-side

### Deploy warning: duplicate key "options" in handler.mjs

**Problem**: `▲ [WARNING] Duplicate key "options" in object literal` during `npm run deploy`
**Cause**: esbuild bundles `@base-ui/react` floating-ui positioning code (dropdown menu) into `.open-next/server-functions/default/handler.mjs`; upstream object literal contains duplicate `options` keys
**Solution**: Safe to ignore — deploy succeeds; smoke-test `/questions` row menu on production. Upgrade `@base-ui/react` when a fix is released upstream

### MCQ pages fail on production with D1 errors

**Problem**: `/questions` returns 500 or "no such table: mcqs" after deploy
**Cause**: Migration `0002_create_mcq_tables.sql` applied locally only; remote D1 not migrated
**Solution**: `npx wrangler d1 migrations apply quizmaker-db --remote` (only when user explicitly wants remote migration)

### Preview smoke test (Phase 5)

**Verified locally (unit suite)**: `npm run test` — 151 tests, 0 failures (2026-09-09)
**Route protection (production)**: Unauthenticated `GET /questions` and `GET /questions/new` redirect to `/login`
**Full browser smoke** (login → create → edit → preview → delete): run manually against `npm run preview` or deployed Workers URL after remote D1 migration is applied

